  "2026-11-17T15:02:08.001Z",codex-sol,"Round AX: verified all six requested review findings. The generator reads the tagged commit committer timestamp via %cI; without a tag it uses the version-derived or explicitly pinned fallback day. Continuation now compares against the verified merge commit day in RELEASE_TIMEZONE before publication; a later mismatch only warns so publish and recover paths still tag. Date matching accepts adjacent shell separators and matching single or double quotes while retaining calendar validation. Source and tracked dist are rebuilt. Initial regressions reproduced the old behavior; one new rewrite assertion incorrectly expected a suffix on a separate standing-policy command and was corrected, then passed. Fresh full coverage and rewritten release-gate acceptance are running. No review-thread mutations, publication, workflow dispatch, merges or closures are authorized."
