  "2026-11-18T12:25:12.826Z",codex-sol,"The pinned-candidate full gate exposed a nested npm fixture that appended --stdout before the inner run-script delimiter, which the canonical grammar correctly refused. The fixture now forwards through both npm delimiters, reaches the real stale-heading check and asserts the retire-unpublished remedy for PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M643thL."
